sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as Trainer Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant JobSet as JobSet Controller
    participant TrainingPod as Training Pod
    participant StatusSrv as Status Server<br/>10443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>openshift-monitoring

    Note over User,StatusSrv: Flow 1: TrainJob Lifecycle

    User->>K8sAPI: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: User credentials
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review<br/>TLS (cluster profile)
    Webhook->>Webhook: Mutate (defaults)<br/>Validate (rules)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch TrainJob<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: TrainJob event

    Controller->>Controller: Resolve TrainingRuntime<br/>Build plugin chain
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create JobSet<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    JobSet->>TrainingPod: Schedule pods<br/>(with init containers)

    Note over TrainingPod: dataset-initializer runs<br/>model-initializer runs<br/>Training begins

    TrainingPod->>StatusSrv: POST /apis/.../status<br/>Auth: OIDC projected SA token<br/>TLS (cluster profile)
    StatusSrv->>StatusSrv: Verify OIDC token<br/>Check namespace binding
    StatusSrv-->>TrainingPod: 200 OK

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Patch TrainJob/status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over Prometheus,Controller: Flow 2: Metrics Scraping

    Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics (8443/TCP)<br/>Auth: Bearer token + TLS<br/>TokenReview + SAR
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Metrics response
